  id: spell-sacred-flame
  displayName: Sacred Flame
  description: Flame-like radiance descends on a creature that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 1d8 radiant damage (treated as generic damage -- no damage-type modeling yet). The spell's damage increases by 1d8 when you reach 5th level (2d8), 11th level (3d8), and 17th level (4d8).
